      "writtenOn": "2024-12-03T21:46:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We always want to regress to relaxed connection parameters from the aggressive connection parameters. We don\u0027t need to state our policy via a variable name. The variable should just denote the state. Policy can be explained in the comments.\n\nSo a better name for this could be `agressive_params_`.\n\nOn the other note, it may have been better to have a single state variable for all connection parameter states.",
      "revId": "25ea7b7c799dc1064c7259ae0e3b9517a5dd1f17",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
